### FusaRoute API — archivo de respaldo para VS Code REST Client
### Usa la extensión "REST Client" de Huachao Mao.
### Variables: ajustar baseUrl y token según el entorno.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = {{$dotenv JWT_TOKEN}}

### ──────────────── 0. SALUD ────────────────

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ──────────────── 1. CATÁLOGO ────────────────

### Listar rutas activas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/routes

### Detalle de ruta
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/routes/1

### Ruta inexistente → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/routes/99999

### ──────────────── 2. REGISTRO ────────────────

### Registro válido
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gladys Rodríguez",
  "email": "gladys.demo@fusaroute.co",
  "password": "GladysPass1"
}

### Registro con datos inválidos → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "no-es-correo",
  "password": "abc"
}

### ──────────────── 3. LOGIN ────────────────

### Login válido → copiar el token de la respuesta
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gladys.demo@fusaroute.co",
  "password": "GladysPass1"
}

### Login con credenciales incorrectas → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gladys.demo@fusaroute.co",
  "password": "clave-incorrecta"
}

### ──────────────── 4. PERFIL ────────────────

### Ver perfil
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar teléfono
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Gladys Rodríguez",
  "email": "gladys.demo@fusaroute.co",
  "phone": "3101234567"
}

### Actualizar con datos inválidos → 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "no-valido",
  "phone": "abc"
}

### Cambiar contraseña → 204
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "currentPassword": "GladysPass1",
  "newPassword": "NuevaClave1"
}

### Contraseña actual incorrecta → 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "currentPassword": "EquivocadaXX1",
  "newPassword": "OtraClave1"
}

### ──────────────── 5. ERRORES ────────────────

### Sin token → 401 con cuerpo JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me

### Token basura → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer no.es.un.jwt

### Content-Type incorrecto → 415 (no 500)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: text/plain

no es json

### Método no permitido → 405 (no 500)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
